          "en": "“And yet I question, sir, whether, in all your experience, you have ever listened to a more mysterious and inexplicable chain of events than those which have happened in my own family.”",
          "es": "\"Y sin embargo me pregunto, señor, si en toda tu experiencia, alguna vez has escuchado una cadena de eventos más misteriosa e inexplicable que la que ha ocurrido en mi propia familia.\""
